Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:12.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:41.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(你会为此下地狱)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.05,0:23:08.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(疏散区)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.33,0:24:02.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(联邦应急管理局)
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.79,0:41:23.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(请依法系好安全带)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:24.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:27.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好你当时不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was good you weren't here for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.27,0:00:29.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She hanging in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.35,0:00:32.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.89,0:00:51.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要把十字架也拆了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna take the cross, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.29,0:00:58.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们需要的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:17.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想去亚特兰大 但我接受不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to go to Atlanta, but I can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.32,0:01:20.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你留下来 我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you stay. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.93,0:01:24.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我欠卡萝尔的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe it to Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.49,0:01:26.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都欠卡萝尔的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all owe Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.92,0:01:30.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我欠她的更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe her more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:56.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.52,0:02:07.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很快就会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.86,0:02:08.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.37,0:04:33.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:37.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我经历过这种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:41.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:47.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍勃 他会希望…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bob, he would have wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:48.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:53.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:56.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你别说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.10,0:05:01.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.16,0:05:28.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是来检查她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just checking on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:11.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们不知道我们在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got no clue we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:14.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这对GREATM是个好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great news for GREATM.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:16.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,GREATM的一个坏消息是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In less great news for GREATM,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:19.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们分完了最后一点水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we just scraped the bottom of the water barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.32,0:06:21.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,GREATM是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is... what's GREATM?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.39,0:06:25.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们 小组名字 团结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Us. Group name. Solidarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:26.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟连\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Band of brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:27.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,GREATM(每个人名的首字母)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}GREATM.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.37,0:06:32.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打算在我的指关节弄个纹身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thinking about getting a tattoo on my knuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.26,0:06:38.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我只是想分分心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, I'm just trying to think of something else, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:39.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:44.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他醒了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:45.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.71,0:06:51.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该送他去教堂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should we get him to the church?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.09,0:06:53.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,移动他可能让他情况更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moving him could make him worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:55.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么会让他好转？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will make him better?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:57.32,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.73,0:06:59.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他没有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he doesn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.49,0:07:08.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:10.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一整天都没喝水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't had anything to drink all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.33,0:07:14.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿着瓶子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:18.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的 我六岁的侄子都不这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously, my six- year-old nephew didn't pull this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:23.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样 亚伯拉罕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do this, Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.11,0:07:26.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 看着我 - 别惹我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look at me! - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.81,0:07:28.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:41.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下 不然我崩了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down or I'll put you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:11.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 接下来该做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what's next on the agenda?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.83,0:08:14.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日落时分 我们朝天空开一枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At sundown we fire a shot into the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:16.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,引两个人出来巡逻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get two of them out on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:17.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等天黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then once it's dark enough
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:20.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,房顶上的人看不见我们时 就行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the rooftop spotter won't see us, we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:22.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把一侧楼梯的锁破坏掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cut the locks on one of the stairways,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:23.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上到五楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}take it to the fifth floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:26.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开门 达里尔干掉守卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I open the door, Daryl takes the guard out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.92,0:08:27.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么干掉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.54,0:08:30.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一刀封喉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He slits his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.93,0:08:35.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次行动必须安静 占据优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is all about us doing this quiet, keeping the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.47,0:08:37.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不知道我们会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not expecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.67,0:08:40.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上楼后分开行动 使用刀具和消音武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From there, we fan out. Knives and silenced weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.95,0:08:42.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,速度一定要快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to be fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:46.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,泰尔西 萨莎 干掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tyreese, Sasha, take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.86,0:08:50.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔 厨房里的人交给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daryl, you take care of whoever is in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.21,0:08:52.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:55.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们识相 剩下的人就会投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they're smart, the rest of them will give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:57.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是5对3了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it'll be five on three.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.29,0:08:59.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给贝丝一把武器 就是6对3了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six on three once we get a weapon to Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:02.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是12对3 病人们会帮我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}12 on three. The wards will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:08.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是最好的打算 那最差的呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's best case. What's worst case?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.73,0:09:12.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有一个警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All it takes is one of those cops
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.60,0:09:14.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在错误的时间下了楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}going down the hall at the wrong time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:18.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就没法安静了 全员火并\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it's not quiet. All hands on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.73,0:09:20.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就得真枪实弹硬来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're talking about a lot of bullets flying around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:23.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 也只能硬来了 - 不见得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If that's what it takes. - It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:25.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we get a couple of her cops
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:29.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活捉她的手下 就可以跟他们换人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}alive out here, we do an even trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:32.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的人换我们的人 大家各回各家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theirs for ours. Everybody goes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:34.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.69,0:09:37.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那招说不定管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.63,0:09:40.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这招一定管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:45.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 那招也管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, that'll work, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.90,0:09:50.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是说道恩只是想让一切正常运转吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say this Dawn, she's just trying to keep it together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.45,0:09:53.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理想和现实是两码事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trying and doing are two different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.27,0:09:56.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓走她的两名警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take two of her cops away,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:58.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还能有什么能耐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what choices does she have?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:00.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都会各回各家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody goes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:02.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像他说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:22.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:26.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要学会自卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to learn how to defend yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:28.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以教你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.44,0:10:35.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自卫？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defend myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:38.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都说会离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said they'd go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.89,0:10:42.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是骗子 杀人凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were liars and murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.31,0:10:45.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们也是 - 我们那是自保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just like us. - We protected ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.41,0:10:46.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想杀我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They wanted us dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:52.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的教堂能撑这么久是运气好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lucky your church has lasted this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.39,0:10:57.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今你不能在一个地方久留\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't stay in one place anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:10:59.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能待太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.17,0:11:03.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦你离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And once you're out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.00,0:11:05.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会遇到无可避免的麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna find trouble you can't hide from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:08.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须学会如何战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to know how to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:21.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.84,0:11:24.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但握法不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're not holding it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:26.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须能捅下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to be able to drive it down
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:28.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为有时候它们的头骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because sometimes their skulls
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:30.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点硬 你必须能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}aren't as soft and you need to be able...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:31.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:36.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:40.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得躺一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:50.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的计划？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your plan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.78,0:11:52.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我们已经尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, we are doing everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:54.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉卡瑞现在还在开着车找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Licari is out in the sedan right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.41,0:11:56.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有诺亚的踪迹 我们会找到他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there is a sign of Noah, we are going to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:12:00.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚说过 你的计划是指望着他自己遇险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just told me that your plan was counting on him screwing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.54,0:12:04.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身为警察 你办事还真是靠谱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's some active police work right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:10.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有别的事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.58,0:12:13.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 还真有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, actually, there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.43,0:12:16.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在二号诊室的病人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The patient in exam room two,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.72,0:12:19.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把她带回来的时候 她已经半死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she was half dead when I brought her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:21.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的情况不太乐观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not looking so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.87,0:12:24.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是竹篮打水的游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ain't Pin the Tail On the Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.79,0:12:28.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们真要在这个女人身上浪费资源吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we really gonna keep wasting valuable resources on this lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:30.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的DVD要用多少电？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much electricity does your DVD take?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.99,0:12:34.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说什么？- 我们的资源很有限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me? - We have very limited resources here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.92,0:12:36.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你每天都给它充电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You charge it every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.26,0:12:39.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你开玩笑吗？ - 贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you kidding me? - Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:43.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那个女人才来这里一天 - 贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That woman has been here one day. - Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.06,0:12:45.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这地方连救人也做不到 它还有什么好呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What good is this place if it doesn't try to save people?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.53,0:12:47.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关闭设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn off the machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:51.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉爱德华兹不用再检查那个病人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell Edwards to take the patient off of his rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:53.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果她自己挺过来了 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she pulls through on her own, then fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:55.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你说得对 她不值得再付出资源了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're right. She's not worth the effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.51,0:13:09.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你害死了那个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just killed that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:12.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我敢站在你一边吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you think I have to side with?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.99,0:13:15.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟他说 你改变主意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him. Tell him you changed your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:18.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道我的统治有多脆弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know how fragile this thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.64,0:13:20.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无能为力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:26.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以必须由你来做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you'll just have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:30.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去救那个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna save that woman's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.31,0:13:36.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是药物储藏室的钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is to the drug locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:38.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不放心交给爱德华兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even trust Edwards with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:39.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:42.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是夏普德 我在屋顶站岗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Shepherd. I'm on roof detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.19,0:13:45.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北东北方向一英里处传来了枪声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just heard a gunshot maybe a mile north- northeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.69,0:13:48.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫上拉姆森 开辆车去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab Lamson, take a car and track it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:50.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遵命 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:54.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要这样做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:56.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前以为你很弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:00.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你用实际行动证明了我是错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've proved me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.98,0:14:05.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要更多的水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.41,0:14:07.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路前面的西南方有条小溪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a creek up the road
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:08.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离这里只有几英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a few miles southwest of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:13.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都去吧 我留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all go. I'll stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.91,0:14:14.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.03,0:14:15.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.80,0:14:21.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.23,0:14:52.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待着别动 伙计们 别起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stay here, guys. Don't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:54.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,华盛顿没什么可给你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing for you in Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:57.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:15:00.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是一点都不好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not not not not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.66,0:15:02.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们都有自己的应对方法…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I get that we're all dealing with things in different ways...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:05.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 华盛顿泡汤了 我不知该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I don't know what to do without DC anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.33,0:15:09.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我并没有应对什么 我已经走出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm not dealing with it. I'm over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.39,0:15:11.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是希望他一切安好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want him to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.70,0:15:13.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金不够强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eugene wasn't strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.34,0:15:16.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,速度不够快 连武器都不会用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He isn't fast. He doesn't know how to use a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:19.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真相是残酷的 但他确实是个没用的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth hurts, but he's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:21.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他拥有一项得以保命的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had one skill that kept him living.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:23.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他加以利用 我们就该生他的气吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we supposed to be mad at him 'cause he used it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.93,0:15:28.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太他妈对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.41,0:16:54.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get over yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:16:59.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天不只你一个人失去了重要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not the only one who lost something today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.19,0:17:04.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切不可能变得比现在更好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's never gonna get any better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:24.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:26.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以进去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:30.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:40.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在二号诊室的那个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The woman in exam room two,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:42.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会给她用什么药？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what medicine would you give her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.45,0:17:44.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩下令停止治疗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn called it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:47.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 但如果可以 你会用什么药？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, but if you could, what would you give her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.75,0:17:51.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她遭遇了车祸 受了内伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was in a car accident. She suffered internal injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:52.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只能大概猜猜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a guessing game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:54.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就猜吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:56.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:00.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你偷来的 还是她给你的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you take it or did she give it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.08,0:18:03.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果钥匙是她给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if she gave it to you, she did not do it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.55,0:18:05.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 她绝对没安好心 - 别说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- out of the kindness of her heart. - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:07.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我用什么药就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just tell me what medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:09.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那样做是想保命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was trying to save my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.56,0:18:14.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我依然不知道是否保住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still wondering if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:20.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肾上腺素滴注 五毫克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Epinephrine drip, five milligrams.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.58,0:18:23.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不会马上醒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She won't wake up right away,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.98,0:18:26.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这会缓解她的血压\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it'll ease her blood pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.03,0:18:27.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样她就有生存的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so she'll have a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:36.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.91,0:18:50.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:53.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得上游的水会清澈一些吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think it's any clearer upstream?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:18:58.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:01.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.69,0:19:04.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.94,0:19:11.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在两分钟内就做好了一个滤水器啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you just built a water filter in about two minutes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:13.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金教我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eugene taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:16.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这需要一些时间 但水会清澈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Takes a while, but it'll be clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:17.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们可以烧水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we can boil it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:22.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾变之前 你和亚伯拉罕在一起吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you with Abraham before it all happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:23.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.39,0:19:27.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我跟别人在一起 努力生存下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I was with other people just trying to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.13,0:19:32.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么到一起的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you wind up together?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:37.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在达拉斯遇上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We crossed paths in Dallas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:40.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和我的团队在击退行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and my group, we were fighting off some dead ones
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:42.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他开着大卡车 不知道从哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he jumped in from out of nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.75,0:19:44.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冒了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with that big truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:45.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿那辆卡车安息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:48.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤金在驾驶室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had Eugene in the cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:51.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后 他告诉我 他在拯救世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And afterwards, he told me that he was trying to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:55.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他看到了我的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that he saw what I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:19:57.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他需要我的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he wanted my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:03.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从灾变之后 他是第一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was the first person to ask me for that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:04.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寻求我帮助的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since this all started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.57,0:20:12.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许他也在撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he was lying, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:24.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:27.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些波纹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those ripples.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.40,0:20:30.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.26,0:20:33.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.43,0:20:35.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:39.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪声是从那边传出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shots were from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.61,0:20:41.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对天发誓我听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to God I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.39,0:20:45.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边 那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. There!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:55.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 放下 诺亚 - 放下枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put it down, Noah. - Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.35,0:21:01.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举起手来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:02.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,转身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.60,0:21:13.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得太紧了就告诉我 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let me know if it's too tight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.19,0:21:14.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你很聪明 诺亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were smart, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.41,0:21:15.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们听不到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think we wouldn't hear you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.70,0:21:22.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你射击的行尸呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are those rotters you were shooting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:24.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举起手来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:25.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.08,0:21:27.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你们要干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever this is,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.57,0:21:29.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都可以帮忙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.39,0:21:33.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按我们说的做 我们就不伤害你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do what we say, we don't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:38.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.54,0:21:44.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好 现在转过身去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Now turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.74,0:21:47.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪放在地上 然后跪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your guns on the floor and kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.39,0:22:00.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.21,0:22:05.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如你们需要的话 这儿有水和食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's water if you need some and food.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:10.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,介意我问你一件事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind if I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.11,0:22:17.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说话的方式…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way you talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.73,0:22:21.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你举手投足之间…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the way you carry yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.99,0:22:25.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前是警察吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were you a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.92,0:22:30.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,信不信由你 我以前也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe it or not, I was, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:33.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是拉姆森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Lamson.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.30,0:22:35.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会支持我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be down for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:37.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's one of the good ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.85,0:23:39.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个 我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two, on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.69,0:25:09.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.69,0:25:12.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你赢了 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You win, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.53,0:25:28.39,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.64,0:25:30.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.31,0:25:37.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.78,0:25:40.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三个人总比两个好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}three is better than two.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.54,0:26:05.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的朋友 他叫什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend, what's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.08,0:26:07.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得和他谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.13,0:26:08.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的计划会害死我和我朋友的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your plan is going to get me and my friends killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.99,0:26:10.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会成功的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna make it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.65,0:26:13.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前提是你得有别的警察来交换\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would work if you had different cops to trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.81,0:26:16.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩把格拉迪医院管得一团糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn's running Grady into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.89,0:26:19.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们中有一些人想让她下台 她自己也清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bunch of us want her out and she knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.15,0:26:21.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很确定她也知道我们想让拉姆森来取代她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty sure she knows we want Lamson to replace her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.83,0:26:23.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩不知道这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dawn doesn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.17,0:26:24.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可能知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She might.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.18,0:26:26.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且她很聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she's smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.51,0:26:29.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你们的交易很可能失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So there's a good chance you can't make this deal work
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.88,0:26:31.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会让我们全部送命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that'll leave us all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.63,0:26:34.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但假如你让我们走的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you let us go,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.57,0:26:36.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会自己解决了道恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll take care of Dawn ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.23,0:26:39.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们会放走你的朋友们 这事就结了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then we'll let your friends go and this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.91,0:26:43.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我们不会这么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we're not gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.34,0:26:47.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你想死吗？ - 不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you want to die? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.88,0:26:50.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是需要你马上闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need you to shut up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.11,0:26:58.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以成功的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can make this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.59,0:27:01.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你们得先和她通上话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you've got to be able to talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.96,0:27:03.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺亚告诉了我们关于她的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noah told us all about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.39,0:27:06.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识她八年了 女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've known her for eight years, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.35,0:27:08.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解这个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.08,0:27:13.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想和平解决此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my only interest is peaceful resolution,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.04,0:27:15.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.09,0:27:18.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚睡在我自己的床上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sleeping in my bed tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.43,0:27:20.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 求你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.37,0:27:23.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我帮你们吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.55,0:27:26.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.76,0:27:32.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克 来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.04,0:27:34.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会想听听这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna want to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.72,0:28:05.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗西塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rosita.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.50,0:28:13.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那边怎么样 塔拉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how are we doing over there, Tara?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.56,0:28:21.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很不错 你们呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty damn good. How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.17,0:28:27.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个十字螺丝刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A screwdriver. Phillips head.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.08,0:28:29.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.59,0:28:32.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.36,0:28:34.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.78,0:28:37.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 太棒了 - 管用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hell, yes. - It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.77,0:28:39.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.76,0:28:41.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道怎么洗吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how to clean these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.07,0:28:42.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how to clean these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:44.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 我们需要这项能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, we're gonna need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.84,0:28:51.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论我们最后去哪里 你加入吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wherever we all wind up. You in?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.11,0:28:57.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我加入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.62,0:29:01.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 太好了 - 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good. - Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.98,0:29:04.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包里的东西肯定会让你们大吃一惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will never believe what's in this bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.96,0:29:08.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.78,0:29:11.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.92,0:29:13.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才说自己不舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you said you weren't feeling good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.72,0:29:15.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.64,0:29:19.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事 我只是休息一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I was just resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.76,0:29:25.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你没经历过这种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know all this is new to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.51,0:29:29.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.22,0:29:34.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.32,0:29:37.68,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想让你知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for you to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.32,0:29:41.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做的事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the things that we do...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.88,0:29:45.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,值得去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.75,0:29:48.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经拿了砍刀 你还想让我怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already took the machete. What more do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.31,0:29:50.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是想让你怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want anything from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.17,0:29:53.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.29,0:29:59.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.36,0:30:57.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来了 快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.02,0:30:59.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我喘不了… - 没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't... I can't... - You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.92,0:31:01.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我喘不上气了 - 快去叫爱德华兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't breathe. - Get Edwards now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.55,0:31:03.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你去取张轮床 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You, get a gurney. - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.70,0:31:04.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事 看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.88,0:31:06.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 看着我 - 放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look at me. - Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.07,0:31:07.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸 深呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe. Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.07,0:31:14.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 放松 放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.84,0:31:16.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持清醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.85,0:31:22.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.62,0:31:24.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.52,0:31:28.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I... I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.28,0:31:31.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道怎么回事 谢谢你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what that was. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.63,0:32:15.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.15,0:32:21.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.33,0:32:29.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想告诉你我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanted you to know that I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.11,0:33:12.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要说出来 你好好听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna say it and you're gonna listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.51,0:33:16.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你准备好了 就让我帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, when you're ready, you let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.17,0:33:19.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟他道别过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to say good- bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.93,0:33:24.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他看到了 也感受到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saw it. He felt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.41,0:33:27.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在想纠结哪点都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you hold onto whatever you want to,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.76,0:33:29.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我觉得你应该铭记这点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I think you should hold onto that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.47,0:33:37.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本应该自己下手的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have been able to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.25,0:33:40.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could've.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.45,0:33:43.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你让自己去感受了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you let yourself feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.89,0:33:45.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁开眼睛直面了一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kept your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.81,0:33:48.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让我帮你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.91,0:35:16.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会说她不做交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll tell you she won't make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.55,0:35:20.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会说她绝不妥协\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll tell you she won't compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.61,0:35:22.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she will.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.41,0:35:24.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她总是妥协\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.82,0:35:30.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 知己知彼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just... just know who you're talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.23,0:35:35.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们大概十分钟后出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably heading out in the next 10 minutes or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.77,0:35:37.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走之前你需要什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything you need before we leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.22,0:35:41.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我点水就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, water would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.60,0:35:44.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.96,0:35:47.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 拉姆森警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, Sergeant Lamson.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.26,0:35:49.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫鲍勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name's Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.78,0:35:54.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你依然是个警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're still a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.64,0:35:56.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.31,0:36:00.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 真的警察都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, the real ones are all gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.37,0:37:03.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.56,0:37:19.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm... I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.66,0:37:21.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.08,0:37:24.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.92,0:37:26.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停车场里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The parking lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.80,0:37:30.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你带我们回这儿的时候 我看见一只行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you were bringing us back up here I... I saw a rotter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.16,0:37:34.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到其中一只行尸 我认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw one of the rotters and I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.95,0:37:49.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫泰勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name was Tyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.48,0:37:51.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在格拉迪见过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I met him at Grady.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.20,0:37:55.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是在灾变后被派到那里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were both sent there when shit started going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.89,0:38:00.17,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整整两天才疏散完所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It took two whole days to evacuate everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.17,0:38:02.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有睡觉 没有吃饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't sleep. We didn't eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.32,0:38:07.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那依然是我这辈子最美好的两天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But still, it was the two best days of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.24,0:38:11.86,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本该开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was supposed to drive
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.06,0:38:14.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把最后一车幸存者载到安全区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the last van of survivors to the zone
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.98,0:38:16.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道恩没让我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Dawn pulled me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.21,0:38:19.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她想要她真正信任的人开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wanted someone she could really trust
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.74,0:38:21.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是她派了泰勒去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she put Tyler on it instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.26,0:38:26.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人都将疏散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These... these people were gonna all be evacuated.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.70,0:38:28.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was really pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.26,0:38:30.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚在外面看到了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw him out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.35,0:38:35.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑身溶化 黏在柏油路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stuck out there, melted to the asphalt.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.14,0:38:39.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我能想到的只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all I could think was,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.67,0:38:42.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"那本该是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"That would have been me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.25,0:38:46.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那本该是我 他救了我的命"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would have been me. He saved my life."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.67,0:38:48.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么久以来 他一直在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been out there the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.81,0:38:50.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成了街道的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like he's a part of the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.55,0:38:53.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像某种荒谬的 永无止境的笑话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some screwed up, endless joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.79,0:38:58.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我对此无能为力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's nothing I can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.56,0:39:02.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就让我帮你吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.21,0:39:07.81,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得他在哪里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember where he was?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.18,0:39:12.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得 我可以带你去找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I... I can take you right to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.85,0:39:15.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不出去了 但我枪法不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not going out there, but I'm a good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.17,0:39:18.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.86,0:39:22.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.06,0:39:27.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大楼南面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}South side of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.67,0:39:30.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里能看到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can see him from in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.00,0:39:54.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你渴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.70,0:39:56.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说自己不渴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.76,0:40:09.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才想让我开枪杀了你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you want me to shoot you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.61,0:40:14.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.14,0:40:19.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.19,0:40:33.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell... hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.74,0:40:35.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.99,0:40:43.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待在原地 不要动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay right there. Don't try to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.14,0:40:45.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.61,0:40:55.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗？ 我又想了想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the more I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.85,0:40:58.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许那并不是完全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe it wasn't completely
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.86,0:41:01.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not not not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.51,0:41:07.43,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.47,0:41:11.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别看了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't even look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.93,0:41:40.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到他了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.83,0:41:45.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概在轿车右边20码处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 20 yards right of the sedan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.63,0:41:51.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里有半面墙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a half wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.31,0:41:55.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就靠在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's leaning against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.61,0:42:03.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.27,0:42:06.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定是他吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure that's him?
